      "created_at": "2018-09-10T16:27:59Z",
      "updated_at": "2018-09-10T16:27:59Z",
      "body": "it looks like it may be possible to disable linking from a local account to a federated account entirely (while still allowing the reverse, which requires a password) as of [this pull request](https://github.com/wso2/product-is/pull/3673/files) - which could be used as a temporary workaround for the issue.",
